Third-party code
================

Exilum Player is built from the components below. Each keeps its own licence;
GPL-3.0-or-later is the licence of the whole, which every one of them allows.
One of them, the PlayStation's sound unit, comes under version 3 without the
words "or any later version": while it is part of the build, the build as a
whole is under version 3.
The app lists them all, with their licence texts, under Settings > About.


